// How many hosts on the account run a product, and at which versions. The
// account-wide answer to "is this one host, or deployed software?". Run it when
// a detection names a product: the file is one, a rule name or description
// cites one, or s1_host_apps tied a cached installer to one. Compare the
// versions with the range the rule or campaign names. Counts only, never raw
// rows: anyHost is one example host per version, not a host list.
// Placeholders: {APP} = product name fragment, lower-cased (e.g. "contoso").
sentinelOneApplication
| where tolower(tostring(name)) contains "{APP}" or tolower(tostring(publisher)) contains "{APP}"
| summarize hosts = dcount(tostring(agentComputerName)),
            anyHost = take_any(tostring(agentComputerName))
    by name = tostring(name), version = tostring(version), publisher = tostring(publisher)
| order by hosts desc
| take 1000
